 ShowModalAndWait←{
     ⍝ ⍺ ←→ Document
     ⍝ ⍵ ←→ dialog element
     ⍺.Document.LastInputMethod←''
     b←GetBody ⍺
     _←b AppendChild ⍵
     _←⍵ ExecuteOnElement'showModal()'
     _←PutDoneToken ⍵ ⍝ Needed if running in test mode
                      ⍝ because modal form would have been popped up by Click function
     ⍝ I have the feeling I changed this to ⍵.Tid but it was not saved.
     ⊃⎕TGET ⎕TID      ⍝ Should be ⍵.Tid?
 }
